# longsubject.rxt -- [M6.6.3] D27 corpus, sec 10.1 population
# requirement 3 (R33 C1-6): a long-subject leading multi-branch
# lookbehind. Without a block like this, sec 3.7's work-charge
# shape is reasoned about and never measured.

# pcre2-only
# sec 10.1 requirement 3 (R33 C1-6): a long-subject leading multi-branch lookbehind, four DIFFERENT fixed widths, exercising sec 3.7's n*sum(k_i) work-charge shape across a 300+ byte scan -- the one shape that can reach PCREC_ERR_WORK where PCRE2 matches.
pattern (?<=a|bb|ccc|dddd)X
features lookaround
m "" 301 302
m "" 302 303
m "" 303 304
m "" 304 305
m "" 4 5
n ""
n ""

# pcre2-only
# requirement 3 x requirement 2 combined: long leading multi-branch lookbehind, both from startpos 0 (forward scan) and from startpos placed exactly at the hit.
pattern (?<=a|bb|ccc|dddd)X
features lookaround
ms 303 "" 303 304
m "" 303 304

